  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Thinly slice the zucchini. Reserve a few whole leaves, then coarsely chop the mint, discarding the stems. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Slice the haloumi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248828/photos/large/prep_ingredients-343e749e92fda23c05c0f74563cdae00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook zucchini: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the zucchini, stirring, for 4 mins or until just tender. Add the garlic and chermoula seasoning and cook, stirring, for 30 secs or until fragrant. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248829/photos/large/fry_lamb-02d405384308611f6e550f4bd306e11f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add couscous: Stir the couscous and 200ml boiling water into the zucchini mixture. Cover and remove the pan from the heat. Stand for 5 mins or until the water is absorbed. Fluff with a fork. Stir in half the chopped mint. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248830/photos/large/fry_zucchini-64c34f4c8e0adf13d7f930bd306d8bc3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook haloumi: Meanwhile, heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi for 2 mins each side or until golden. Remove from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248831/photos/large/add_couscous-2ba9e1480fd9ed7bbbcab2d631edb060.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Combine the yoghurt, remaining chopped mint and 1 tsp red wine vinegar in a bowl. Divide the couscous pilaf among bowls and top with the haloumi, mint yoghurt and reserved mint leaves. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248832/photos/large/serve_up-486f0929069bf1c07a4a57c3f0b09952.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you have some on hand, scatter over some toasted pepitas or slivered almonds for crunch.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248833/photos/large/make_it_yours-5ce41fec3c1d74f079aacb5521d8bd84.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
